      "message": "Also need to enable the pwm controller node from the SoC.   I see you have this in the example, but it would be good to call out here.\n\nFor Nuvoton, the \"clock-bus\" property needs to be set to the LFCLK for any PWMs that need to be active during low-power modes.  In general board LEDs, especially power/battery LEDs, are used during low-power.",
